---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="页面不存在"
	description="这个地址不存在 —— KnowWhy|知其所以然,用一个「为什么」探索世界。"
	noindex
>
	<section class="not-found">
		<img class="nf-mascot" src="/mascot/Mascot-Thinking.png" alt="小问托腮思考" />
		<p class="nf-code">404</p>
		<h1>这个页面不存在</h1>
		<p class="nf-desc">
			地址可能被挪走、改名,或者从来就没有过。<br />让小问陪你从首页重新出发。
		</p>
		<div class="nf-actions">
			<a class="nf-btn nf-btn-primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
			<a class="nf-btn" href="/why/">逛逛 WHY</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.not-found {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		padding-block: 3.5rem 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.nf-mascot {
		width: min(58vw, 240px);
		height: auto;
	}

	.nf-code {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.22em;
		color: var(--amber-deep);
	}

	.not-found h1 {
		margin-top: 0.4rem;
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
	}

	.nf-desc {
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.nf-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 1.6rem;
	}

	.nf-btn {
		padding: 0.55rem 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--ink);
		transition:
			border-color 150ms ease,
			color 150ms ease;
	}

	.nf-btn:hover {
		border-color: var(--amber);
		color: var(--amber-deep);
	}

	.nf-btn-primary {
		border-color: transparent;
		background: var(--amber);
		color: var(--ink-deep);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.nf-btn-primary:hover {
		border-color: transparent;
		background: #fbbf24;
		color: var(--ink-deep);
	}
</style>
